          roles: [],
          customActions: [],
          deckDescription: 'One 36-card deck derived from a standard 52-card French pack by removing all 2s, 3s, 4s, 10s and jokers. Four suits (clubs, spades, hearts, diamonds) remain, each with six through ace for use with Brus-style beating cards and sevens.',
          suitDescription: 'Four French suits (clubs, spades, hearts, diamonds) with a fixed suit ordering where clubs are strongest, then spades, hearts and diamonds. There is no single trump suit; special beating cards and sevens use the suit order to decide which cards can win tricks.',
          rankDescription: 'Each suit uses the ranks 6, 7, 8, 9, 10, jack, queen, king and ace. Within this reduced deck the Jack of clubs, King of hearts, Eight of spades and the groups of nines, aces, jacks and sixes form the main beating cards, while sevens and remaining cards act as special or worthless cards depending on how they are led.',
          dealPattern: '',
